WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:06.040
New Year's Eve, here at a diner
as the year comes to an end.

00:06.830 --> 00:08.040
A literal...

00:13.330 --> 00:15.170
...hell on earth.

00:16.080 --> 00:18.330
So, you two are in the same class?

00:18.330 --> 00:19.420
Yeah...

00:19.630 --> 00:21.670
Whaaat? Are we?

00:21.960 --> 00:22.960
C'mon, Icchi.

00:22.960 --> 00:24.330
Switch places with me.

00:24.500 --> 00:25.960
So...

00:26.330 --> 00:28.750
What's Yamada up to?

00:30.790 --> 00:34.130
It was just four days ago...

02:06.290 --> 02:09.170
Every year we head back up to Akita.

02:09.380 --> 02:13.330
Cold as it is, it's warmer than usual, right dear?

02:13.330 --> 02:14.380
Mhmm.

02:14.630 --> 02:17.250
Goodness be, you look all growed up-

02:17.250 --> 02:19.080
He's still tiny.

02:21.130 --> 02:24.920
Sure we might be in Akita,
but nothing else has really changed.

02:25.250 --> 02:26.710
The only problem is...

02:28.000 --> 02:28.630
Hrmph!

02:28.630 --> 02:30.420
I'm stuck sharing a room with her.

02:30.420 --> 02:33.080
What? Too early to roll out the beds?

02:33.080 --> 02:34.420
It's not that...

02:34.500 --> 02:37.000
Oh come on, don't give me that look.

02:37.000 --> 02:38.880
We shared a room last year, too.

02:38.880 --> 02:41.710
Yeah, things are just the same as last year.

02:41.710 --> 02:42.920
Except for...

02:46.330 --> 02:47.380
It's from Yamada.

02:47.920 --> 02:49.880
Food again, of course...

02:50.210 --> 02:51.750
Speaking of Yamada...

02:52.210 --> 02:53.710
Akita, huh?

02:53.710 --> 02:56.960
My parents are both from the Kanto region,
so I'm kinda jealous.

02:56.960 --> 02:59.630
Wish I could see the snow up there.

02:59.790 --> 03:04.080
Oh, well... I could send a picture... Of the snow and all...

03:05.080 --> 03:07.670
Would you? Promise me!

03:17.130 --> 03:18.460
Where you off to?

03:18.460 --> 03:19.580
A walk...

03:28.880 --> 03:30.290
It's so quiet.

03:36.420 --> 03:38.630
<b>Portrait</b>

03:36.420 --> 03:38.630
<b>Photo</b>

03:36.420 --> 03:38.630
<b>Video</b>

03:43.170 --> 03:44.210
Bwah!

03:50.210 --> 03:51.830
Kyo-chan!

03:52.380 --> 03:54.210
Kyo-chan!

03:54.630 --> 03:56.580
How far did he go?

03:56.790 --> 03:57.420
Hmm?

04:01.710 --> 04:04.580
Kyo-chan! Are you okay?!

04:07.210 --> 04:09.460
Yeah, just taking a nap...

04:09.630 --> 04:12.500
Like heck you were! Can you stand?

04:16.830 --> 04:18.040
And there you have it.

04:21.210 --> 04:24.880
We just got here and this is my situation already...

04:25.170 --> 04:27.880
Why'd you walk all the way out to that cliff?

04:28.290 --> 04:29.210
Dunno.

04:29.210 --> 04:30.750
Got too excited, I guess...

04:30.750 --> 04:32.460
Like I believe that.

04:32.880 --> 04:36.000
I AM pretty excited, though...

04:36.250 --> 04:43.130
You know, this is probably the first time you've
ever been naughty and hurt yourself, I think.

04:43.330 --> 04:44.830
I wasn't being "naughty."

04:45.960 --> 04:49.670
She's probably catching on to something
with those motherly intuitions.

04:51.830 --> 04:52.830
Doesn't this look wonderful?

04:52.830 --> 04:54.420
Dinner that night seemed a bit extravagant...
Doesn't this look wonderful?<b></b>

04:54.420 --> 04:55.250
Dinner that night seemed a bit extravagant...

04:55.250 --> 04:56.750
Come on, say, "Aaah."

04:56.750 --> 04:57.750
Cut it out.

04:58.630 --> 05:00.670
Maybe I should take a selfie.

05:01.500 --> 05:03.080
And send it to her.

05:03.540 --> 05:04.710
Bet I'd get a laugh...

05:06.330 --> 05:07.130
Huh?

05:08.960 --> 05:10.290
A video call...

05:15.500 --> 05:16.880
<b>Anna Yamada</b>

05:16.960 --> 05:18.000
Hey, you there?

05:18.830 --> 05:20.670
Glasses?! And pajamas?!

05:20.670 --> 05:23.460
Hey, can you hear me?

05:23.580 --> 05:26.630
Gah, and I can't even sneak one in, today!

05:26.630 --> 05:28.960
Hey, w-what's this about?

05:28.960 --> 05:30.500
That's what I wanna know.

05:30.580 --> 05:32.290
What happened to your arm?

05:32.290 --> 05:34.710
Nothing, just took a fall.

05:34.710 --> 05:37.380
It doesn't really hurt or anything.

05:38.710 --> 05:40.000
You had me worried.

05:40.250 --> 05:41.670
Hmm? Ack!

05:45.830 --> 05:50.170
I'll be headed straight back home tomorrow now, though.

05:50.170 --> 05:52.880
Yeah? That's too bad.

05:52.880 --> 05:53.960
What can you do?

05:54.710 --> 05:58.130
W-well maybe when you get back...

06:04.670 --> 06:06.000
H-hello...

06:06.960 --> 06:07.790
Ack!

06:08.290 --> 06:09.540
I hung up...

06:10.170 --> 06:12.000
She was cute.

06:12.000 --> 06:15.290
T-that was just a girl from my class.

06:15.290 --> 06:16.670
Sorry, must have woke you up.

06:16.670 --> 06:19.000
Wait, that wasn't some streamer or something?

06:19.540 --> 06:20.750
Me and my big mouth!

06:20.750 --> 06:22.830
She was super cute.

06:23.000 --> 06:28.630
Yeah, well, you know,
we all have guy friends and girl friends...

06:28.960 --> 06:30.130
I don't.

06:30.330 --> 06:31.130
Sorry.

06:31.790 --> 06:36.630
Okay, but like... I dunno if we're even friends...

06:37.210 --> 06:40.460
Pull yourself together, man!
If she picks up on this...

06:40.630 --> 06:42.420
Well, do you like her?

06:42.420 --> 06:44.670
Are you going out? I wanna meet her.

06:44.670 --> 06:45.880
It'll never end.

06:48.750 --> 06:50.920
Yeah? All right...

06:51.630 --> 06:54.330
Hurry up and get to sleep. I'm beat.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.790
She's not gonna drill me?

06:57.790 --> 07:00.000
Somehow that feels even worse.

07:01.540 --> 07:02.540
<b>Phone call ended</b>

07:01.540 --> 07:02.540
<b>Don't hang up!</b>

07:02.540 --> 07:06.250
<b>Yeeeeeah!</b>

07:03.670 --> 07:06.250
I don't think that's what that sticker is for...

07:09.790 --> 07:10.880
<b>Sorry</b>

07:09.790 --> 07:10.880
<b>My sister's super annoying</b>

07:10.920 --> 07:11.920
<b>What did you say</b>

07:11.960 --> 07:13.000
<b>What did you say</b>

07:11.960 --> 07:13.000
<b>to her?</b>

07:15.040 --> 07:16.250
<b>Sorry</b>

07:15.040 --> 07:16.250
<b>My sister's super annoying</b>

07:15.040 --> 07:16.250
<b>What did you say</b>

07:15.040 --> 07:16.250
<b>to her?</b>

07:16.290 --> 07:18.540
<b>That we're friends</b>

07:18.580 --> 07:19.830
<b>That we're friends</b>

07:18.580 --> 07:19.830
<b>I guess</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:20.790
<b>That we're friends</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:20.790
<b>I guess</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:20.790
<b>for now</b>

07:20.920 --> 07:23.540
"For now..."?

07:28.580 --> 07:34.710
I've used the word "friend" so
little it didn't even autofill for me...

07:33.080 --> 07:35.040
<b>Sorry</b>

07:33.080 --> 07:35.040
<b>My sister's super annoying</b>

07:33.080 --> 07:35.040
<b>What did you say</b>

07:33.090 --> 07:35.040
<b>to her?</b>

07:33.090 --> 07:35.040
<b>That we're friends</b>

07:33.090 --> 07:35.040
<b>I guess</b>

07:33.090 --> 07:35.040
<b>for now</b>

07:35.080 --> 07:38.290
<b>On the way</b>

07:36.210 --> 07:38.040
What is that even supposed to mean?

07:38.670 --> 07:39.290
<b>Your sister</b>

07:39.290 --> 07:40.830
<b>Your sister</b>

07:39.290 --> 07:40.830
<b>Is she asleep?</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:42.080
<b>Your sister</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:42.080
<b>Is she asleep?</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:42.080
<b>Can I call?</b>

07:42.170 --> 07:43.710
She wants to talk again?!

07:44.790 --> 07:45.920
That was fast!

07:48.790 --> 07:50.420
Is your sister asleep?

07:50.790 --> 07:53.630
I'm out in the hall now, so it's fine.

07:54.000 --> 07:56.830
Oh... How's your arm?

07:56.960 --> 08:00.250
Fine, yeah. Kinda annoying, is all.

08:00.750 --> 08:02.080
Yeah?

08:03.040 --> 08:07.790
Well, if it's not too much to ask-
Do have anything to drink nearby?

08:08.080 --> 08:09.380
A drink...?

08:13.750 --> 08:15.960
<b>Tea</b>

08:14.080 --> 08:15.750
Oh, yeah.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.130
Can you reach it?

08:17.130 --> 08:19.290
Yeah, I got it.

08:19.500 --> 08:21.080
Okay, drink it.

08:25.630 --> 08:26.750
Any windows nearby?

08:26.960 --> 08:28.080
Look outside.

08:28.080 --> 08:29.130
Outside...?

08:29.790 --> 08:30.670
<b>Tea</b>

08:38.330 --> 08:40.580
Can't see the moon, huh?

08:54.250 --> 08:57.330
What's this all about, anyway?

08:59.210 --> 09:00.540
Oh, nothing...

09:02.790 --> 09:04.630
<b>No...</b>

09:02.790 --> 09:04.630
<b>I want to be with you.</b>

09:02.790 --> 09:04.630
<b>I wouldn't be otherwise.</b>

09:06.290 --> 09:08.630
Sorry for calling so late.

09:09.040 --> 09:12.040
It's fine. Don't sleep much lately, anyway.

09:12.500 --> 09:16.330
Okay, try putting your free hand on your head, then.

09:19.250 --> 09:25.630
Now move it from top to bottom, three times in a row.

09:27.630 --> 09:28.500
Why?

09:28.670 --> 09:30.500
It's a trick to help you sleep.

09:30.830 --> 09:33.130
You girls love this sorta stuff, huh?

09:34.500 --> 09:36.670
All right, I'll let you go. Goodnight.

09:36.750 --> 09:39.540
Huh? Yeah, g-g'night.

09:40.040 --> 09:41.960
Gah. That was fast.

09:42.250 --> 09:45.130
It was like she was remote controlling me...

09:45.580 --> 09:47.080
<b>Your sister</b>

09:45.580 --> 09:47.080
<b>Is she asleep?</b>

09:45.590 --> 09:47.080
<b>Can I call?</b>

09:45.590 --> 09:47.080
<b>I guess?</b>

09:45.590 --> 09:47.080
<b>Phone call ended</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:48.040
<b>Your sister</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:48.040
<b>Is she asleep?</b>

09:47.090 --> 09:48.040
<b>Can I call?</b>

09:47.090 --> 09:48.040
<b>I guess?</b>

09:47.090 --> 09:48.040
<b>Phone call ended</b>

09:47.090 --> 09:48.040
<b>Night</b>

09:49.080 --> 09:52.580
And so, after all that...

09:54.210 --> 09:58.000
Kyo-chan, you're lookin' right mature.

09:58.000 --> 09:59.920
He looks same as always, though.

09:59.920 --> 10:00.580
Shut up.

10:01.540 --> 10:04.420
I ended up heading back to Tokyo after just a day.

10:04.920 --> 10:07.710
Better at least buy some stuff to take back.

10:04.920 --> 10:06.250
<b>Pickled Daikon Cookies</b>

10:06.250 --> 10:09.000
<b>Welcome to Akita</b>

10:06.250 --> 10:09.000
<b>Keychains</b>

10:07.710 --> 10:09.580
Think three of these will do?

10:09.000 --> 10:10.500
<b>Welcome to Akita</b>

10:09.000 --> 10:10.500
<b>Pickled Daikon Cookies</b>

10:09.000 --> 10:10.500
<b>Keychains</b>

10:09.580 --> 10:10.500
Mhmm.

10:11.380 --> 10:14.460
Yamada loves dogs I think, right?

10:14.460 --> 10:17.670
Wow, that's so cute! Let's get matching ones.

10:17.670 --> 10:19.290
What? I'd never-

10:20.250 --> 10:21.830
Actually, let's do it!

10:22.000 --> 10:23.080
Seriously?

10:23.080 --> 10:24.710
Why are you the one acting disappointed?

10:26.040 --> 10:29.420
If we're friends, a little gift is fine, yeah?

10:30.920 --> 10:32.830
And so this girl, right?

10:32.960 --> 10:37.330
She's adorable, but she's so fickle
and all over the place, yeah?

10:37.330 --> 10:38.170
Mhmm.

10:38.290 --> 10:43.710
So like, girls are more than just their looks.
Charm is what's key.

10:43.710 --> 10:48.540
Why do I feel like she thinks I'm crushing
over someone out of my league?

10:49.210 --> 10:52.210
I mean, I am, but still...

10:53.330 --> 10:56.670
She's just like me in that way.

10:56.920 --> 11:01.130
Always trying to give up on what
she really wants before it hurts.

11:01.290 --> 11:02.960
We're both that sort of type.

11:03.210 --> 11:04.000
But...

11:04.130 --> 11:08.080
<b>Anna Yamada</b>

11:04.130 --> 11:08.080
<b>Uploaded that outfit to the gram</b>

11:04.130 --> 11:08.080
<b>Yeah?</b>

11:04.130 --> 11:08.080
<b>Did you look?</b>

11:04.130 --> 11:08.080
<b>Do it!</b>

11:04.130 --> 11:08.080
<b>Yeah</b>

11:04.710 --> 11:10.380
My head is so fixed on Yamada that I can't even
spend a moment not re-reading our messages.

11:10.710 --> 11:13.710
So that girl you were talking with yesterday-

11:13.710 --> 11:14.540
Yamada.

11:14.750 --> 11:15.920
Yamada...?

11:16.580 --> 11:21.290
Wait, wasn't the friend who left you a
note when you were sick named...

11:21.580 --> 11:23.290
No way! That was her?!

11:22.710 --> 11:26.290
<b>Sorry for causing all this... Cheer up soon!</b>

11:22.710 --> 11:26.290
<b>Yamada</b>

11:23.290 --> 11:26.040
Her handwriting was so bad I assumed she was a boy!

11:26.920 --> 11:30.040
Maybe you do have a chance, then.

11:30.170 --> 11:31.380
Yeah, right...

11:31.380 --> 11:35.170
She seems awfully friendly!
You should introduce us sometime!

11:34.290 --> 11:38.960
<b>Visit Akita Again</b>

11:35.170 --> 11:36.960
Mom, come on, wake up!

11:36.960 --> 11:38.330
Stop it!

11:41.420 --> 11:44.540
Look, it's the matching keychain we bought.

11:44.540 --> 11:46.080
Let's bring them on our temple visit.

11:47.130 --> 11:48.630
Going somewhere?

11:48.630 --> 11:50.830
Just to return some books...

11:51.130 --> 11:53.330
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

11:51.460 --> 11:53.080
Technically, that's not a lie.

11:56.080 --> 12:00.380
Gotta bring the manga,
the scarf from Christmas I forgot to give back,

12:00.750 --> 12:03.460
and this gift from Akita.

12:06.920 --> 12:07.790
Oh!

12:08.170 --> 12:10.710
H-h-hey...

12:11.250 --> 12:12.880
H-h-hey...

12:13.040 --> 12:15.500
I-I thought we were meeting up...

12:15.500 --> 12:18.670
Yeah, but then I remembered you're hurt!

12:18.670 --> 12:21.630
You can't ride a bike like that!

12:21.750 --> 12:25.040
Sure, but what if you'd missed me?

12:28.540 --> 12:31.250
Been a while, huh?

12:31.540 --> 12:33.040
Five days, I guess.

12:33.580 --> 12:34.330
Oh.

12:34.670 --> 12:37.670
This is Wantaro. My dog.

12:40.630 --> 12:41.580
Spin round.

12:44.830 --> 12:49.670
Now that I think about it,
a non-food gift might be a bit much.

12:50.380 --> 12:53.210
It'd probably creep her out knowing
I remembered she likes dogs, too.

12:51.040 --> 12:56.540
<b>Akita</b>

12:53.460 --> 12:55.630
Some kinda snack would have been better...

12:55.710 --> 12:56.540
This is Yamada, after all.

12:57.290 --> 13:01.830
I've been acting without thinking a whole lot lately.

13:02.290 --> 13:04.040
This is where that gets me.

13:04.290 --> 13:05.580
Need to show some restraint...

13:07.040 --> 13:09.290
Here, I opened it for you.

13:09.880 --> 13:10.960
Thanks.

13:15.830 --> 13:18.380
Hey. Try giving him a command.

13:18.380 --> 13:19.420
Me?

13:20.710 --> 13:22.460
S-spin around...

13:29.790 --> 13:30.830
Down.

13:35.880 --> 13:36.670
Paw.

13:40.170 --> 13:41.920
He was just about to do it.

13:42.210 --> 13:43.540
You think?

13:47.670 --> 13:49.540
Her hands are freezing.

13:50.710 --> 13:51.920
Pretty chilly, huh?

13:51.920 --> 13:53.830
A bit, yeah.

13:54.670 --> 13:57.170
Oh yeah, your scarf!

14:01.670 --> 14:02.960
There it is.

14:04.040 --> 14:06.790
I put it in a bag so it wouldn't get dirty.

14:10.880 --> 14:11.880
You know...

14:13.500 --> 14:15.750
I was gonna let you keep it.

14:17.540 --> 14:22.580
But I thought, maybe you wouldn't want it...

14:23.710 --> 14:26.380
And so, like...

14:26.750 --> 14:27.880
Well then...

14:29.290 --> 14:30.290
What?

14:30.960 --> 14:32.920
Just...

14:42.000 --> 14:43.290
It's an Akita dog.

14:43.960 --> 14:45.920
A little souvenir...

14:46.000 --> 14:48.210
<b>We're</b>

14:53.130 --> 14:54.290
Wow!

14:57.960 --> 15:00.630
Ah! Hey, stop it!

15:01.750 --> 15:03.170
Thank you!

15:04.710 --> 15:06.750
Nah, thank you...

15:07.000 --> 15:10.420
<b>A Bit Alike</b>

15:13.130 --> 15:16.250
I think I'll name him Akita Kentaro!

15:16.540 --> 15:19.960
You're the worst at naming things.
That's no dog name.

15:19.960 --> 15:22.880
Hey, Ichikawa, thinking of visiting
a temple for New Year's?

15:23.080 --> 15:24.330
Yeah.

15:24.330 --> 15:26.710
With my family, though.

15:26.710 --> 15:28.630
Really? Yay!

15:28.750 --> 15:32.830
I'll message you the place and time later. Bye-bye!

15:32.830 --> 15:33.290
Wait...

15:34.790 --> 15:36.170
What?

15:38.750 --> 15:40.420
Several days later...

15:40.540 --> 15:42.380
<b>Today</b>

15:40.540 --> 15:42.380
<b>we're all staying at Nyaa's house.</b>

15:41.170 --> 15:45.130
Before I realized it, I was texting Yamada every day.

15:45.420 --> 15:49.830
<b>Sekine's not with you?</b>

15:45.960 --> 15:47.250
Nope. Nope.

15:47.250 --> 15:49.380
Don't wanna be a creep and ask about other girls.

15:49.380 --> 15:51.960
Better play it safe with this one.

15:53.710 --> 15:57.710
I might have let it all get to my head.

15:55.420 --> 15:57.880
<b>Okay. Talk to you tomorrow</b>

15:58.420 --> 15:59.880
<b>December 31 (Tues)</b>

16:01.080 --> 16:03.290
Brr... I'm freezing.

16:03.460 --> 16:05.040
What? For real?

16:05.040 --> 16:06.420
I mean, yeah...

16:06.790 --> 16:08.580
That's New Year's Eve for you.

16:08.790 --> 16:10.790
Better get my drink and get outta here...

16:13.580 --> 16:15.460
Oh, it's the bike kid.

16:16.380 --> 16:18.130
Who's he, again?

16:18.130 --> 16:20.130
Dunno. Beats me.

16:20.540 --> 16:24.500
Wait, you're Ichi-Uhh, Ichi...

16:24.500 --> 16:25.580
Ichihara.

16:25.580 --> 16:27.750
Right, yeah, Ichihara.

16:27.880 --> 16:30.000
<b>Guzdo</b>

16:28.500 --> 16:32.130
And so, here we are.

16:33.630 --> 16:36.960
You listening? What's Yamada up to?

16:36.960 --> 16:39.670
He's trying to use me...

16:39.670 --> 16:42.170
Do you have her LINE?

16:42.290 --> 16:43.460
LINE?

16:43.790 --> 16:47.710
Oh. No. She only communicates
via telepathy or something.

16:47.710 --> 16:52.710
This girl won't tell me, but you're classmates too, right?

16:52.710 --> 16:54.580
Whaaat? Are we?

16:54.670 --> 16:56.210
Pretending not to know me, huh?

16:56.210 --> 16:57.670
Good call.

16:57.670 --> 17:00.460
Would only make things worse if
we said we knew each other.

17:00.460 --> 17:03.540
Wait, isn't this kid the one Yamada-

17:04.580 --> 17:06.830
Oops, sorry.

17:10.130 --> 17:11.830
<b>December 31</b>

17:10.130 --> 17:11.830
<b>Anna Yamada</b>

17:10.130 --> 17:11.830
<b>Don't fall asleep</b>

17:10.500 --> 17:11.830
"Anna Yamada."

17:12.920 --> 17:14.790
You do know it, then.

17:15.250 --> 17:16.830
Way to break my heart.

17:16.830 --> 17:19.290
Oh, no, I just...

17:19.580 --> 17:22.960
Leave the poor kid alone. You're scaring him.

17:23.460 --> 17:27.000
Hey, can you go get a coffee for me?

17:27.130 --> 17:28.080
What?

17:40.170 --> 17:42.580
I'm gonna go get myself a refill, too.

17:48.130 --> 17:50.670
Finally comes down to use of force then, huh...

17:56.460 --> 17:59.210
I won't tell anyone I got it from you, Ichihara.

17:59.210 --> 18:02.210
And I'll tell the girls you wouldn't tell me.

18:02.210 --> 18:04.130
I don't want to cause any trouble.

18:07.500 --> 18:09.080
So, what do you say?

18:17.420 --> 18:19.630
I'm... not telling.

18:20.040 --> 18:20.960
Why?

18:21.500 --> 18:22.670
Gimme a reason.

18:23.830 --> 18:25.380
The reason is...

18:26.330 --> 18:29.630
I don't have one. I just don't want to.

18:34.250 --> 18:36.080
I better get going.

18:36.630 --> 18:39.080
Walk me back, "Ichihara."

18:40.080 --> 18:42.000
It's all dark and scary.

18:42.170 --> 18:44.710
Oh, I can go with you.

18:44.920 --> 18:46.960
No, it's fine.

18:47.460 --> 18:50.130
Me and him are friends, see.

18:59.210 --> 19:02.130
This is bad, I'm almost starting to like her...

19:02.130 --> 19:04.290
Nice work back there, Icchi.

19:04.290 --> 19:05.960
You're a terrible liar, though.

19:05.960 --> 19:08.630
No, I just wasn't ready for that.

19:08.630 --> 19:12.000
You should probably be straight with him, next time.

19:12.040 --> 19:18.380
<b>Laundromat</b>

19:12.080 --> 19:15.460
He's got the wrong idea... About me and Yamada...

19:15.710 --> 19:17.460
The "wrong" idea?!

19:17.790 --> 19:19.000
So...

19:19.630 --> 19:21.130
We can do this, then?

19:21.130 --> 19:22.040
What?!

19:22.250 --> 19:24.420
Never knew you could move that fast.

19:24.580 --> 19:28.250
No, by "wrong" I mean...

19:30.210 --> 19:34.960
I like her, I think...

19:35.580 --> 19:36.630
Ice-cold...

19:40.830 --> 19:41.920
I know!

19:41.920 --> 19:46.170
I know-know-know...

19:47.920 --> 19:51.250
Listen, it's absolutely super obvious.

19:58.290 --> 20:00.170
This should be far enough.

20:00.170 --> 20:01.630
H-hey...

20:02.250 --> 20:03.540
Thanks...

20:03.540 --> 20:07.380
No biggie. Anyone woulda done the same.

20:07.380 --> 20:09.710
No, I mean...

20:13.000 --> 20:14.630
Wanna pop in?

20:15.960 --> 20:18.040
B-bye now. Happy New Year!

20:18.290 --> 20:20.540
Just when I was starting not to hate her!

20:23.580 --> 20:26.580
I said out loud that I like her.

20:26.830 --> 20:30.000
And now I can't help it...

20:41.040 --> 20:42.250
Hello?

20:42.380 --> 20:43.750
H-hey...

20:43.750 --> 20:47.790
W-what's up? Rare for you to call.

20:48.540 --> 20:51.830
I can't help but want to hear her voice.

20:52.080 --> 20:55.790
Oh... Right! Happy New Year!

20:55.790 --> 20:57.460
What? Already?

20:57.540 --> 21:00.210
I wanted to be the first to say it...

21:00.630 --> 21:01.920
Hiya!

21:01.920 --> 21:03.580
Oh, Moeko's here.

21:03.830 --> 21:04.670
What?

21:05.130 --> 21:07.830
O-okay, won't keep you, then...

21:10.830 --> 21:13.750
One of these days I'll tell you...

21:17.210 --> 21:17.830
I like you!

21:19.500 --> 21:22.210
Are trash bins just invisible to you?

21:24.670 --> 21:27.540
<b>We're a Bit Alike</b>
